theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 15
text = "• WASD / Arrows : Movement
• Space : Jump (Press in air for Double Jump!)
• Mouse : Camera Look (Click to lock cursor)
• Shift : Sprint
• Stomp : Jump & land on enemy heads to defeat them!
• Goal : Reach the Golden Beacon on Sky Island!
• Escape / P : Pause Menu
• R : Quick Stage Restart"

